"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":true,"forks_count":6465,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":2020,"license":{"key":"other","name":"Other","spdx_id":"NOASSERTION","url":null,"node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTA="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":["api","c","lua","neovim","nvim","text-editor","vim"],"visibility":"public","forks":6465,"open_issues":2020,"watchers":94890,"default_branch":"master","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neovim/neovim/pulls/24289","html_url":"https://github.com/neovim/neovim/pull/24289","diff_url":"https://github.com/neovim/neovim/pull/24289.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/neovim/neovim/pull/24289.patch","merged_at":"2023-07-26T03:22:57Z"},"body":"Problem:\r\nThe cmdpreview saved undo nodes on `cmdpreview_prepare` from `ex_getln.c` may become invalid (free) if the preview function makes undo operations, causing heap-use-after-free errors.\r\n\r\nSolution:\r\nSave the buffer undo list on `cmdpreview_prepare` and start a new empty one. On `cmdpreview_restore_state`, undo all the entries in the new undo list and restore the original one. With this approach, the preview function will be allowed to undo only its own changes.\r\n\r\nfix #20036\r\nfix #20248","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neovim/neovim/issues/24289/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":2,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neovim/neovim/issues/24289/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":9918627025,"node_id":"DEME_lADOAPphoM5Q9xgGzwAAAAJPMjzR","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neovim/neovim/issues/events/9918627025","actor":{"login":"zeertzjq","id":35768171,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1NzY4MTcx","avatar_url":"h